# Kamen

Live avatar local (ASR + LLM + TTS + lipsync + VLM) para Jetson Thor.
Foco: baixa latencia, 25-30 FPS, PT-BR, open source.

Documentos principais:
- docs/live-avatar-jetson-thor.md
- docs/implementation-plan.md
- docs/services.md
- docs/assets-prep.md
- docs/test-plan.md
- docs/runbook.md

Configs e contratos:
- proto/avatar.proto
- configs/stack/default.yaml
- configs/personas/ana.yaml

Quick start (mock services):
1) pip install -r requirements.txt
2) ./scripts/gen_proto.sh
3) python -m avatar.mock_services --port 50051
